 p('On the synthetic test, B accepts five multiple-target and five occluded cases incorrectly. D and E make no incorrect accepted clicks but reject four and one correctly localized unique cases, respectively. Uniqueness-only accepts all 30 unique targets. The multiple-target B-to-D difference is -50 percentage points; its originally reported Holm-adjusted p=0.126 does not establish significance. The synthetic pilot therefore motivates a transfer check rather than a safety claim.')

