 p('GoClick [5, Table 3] reports standard ScreenSpot-v2 point-grounding results and local timing on one L20 GPU, batch one, 360x780 images. Its task distribution and timing definitions differ from our matched-input experiment. Table values below are historical context rather than new tests or a model ranking.')
