 p('Published local timings separate time to first token (TTFT) and time per output token (TPOT); our timings measure full HTTP response time. Approximate local generation time is TTFT+(L-1)TPOT for L output tokens, with no comparable GPT-4o timing in the selected study. These values cannot establish a Jev speedup.')
 p('For a separate prospective GPT-4o price scenario, official input/output rates [6] are $2.50/$10 per million tokens. The documented high-detail image rules [7] yield 992,205 image tokens for our 951 prepared dimensions. Assuming 250 text-input and 80 output tokens per case gives $3.835688. These prompt lengths are assumptions, not a measured GPT-4o bill or accuracy result.')


